{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00022","headline":"送丘为落第归江东 · 王维","name":"送丘为落第归江东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怜君不得意，况复柳条春。为客黄金尽，还家白发新。 五湖三亩宅，万里一归人。知尔不能荐，羞称献纳臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"陈志明 谢丹月"}